  "body": "Several ReadableStream abstract operations are only called with one particular type of reader. For clarity, it would be good to add assertions of what kind of reader they are called with.\r\n\r\nA (hopefully complete) list of miscellaneous operations that assume the reader type:\r\n\r\nReadableStreamFulfillReadIntoRequest\r\nReadableStreamFulfillReadRequest\r\nReadableStreamGetNumReadIntoRequests\r\nReadableStreamGetNumReadRequests\r\n\r\nAlready have assertions:\r\n\r\nReadableStreamAddReadIntoRequest\r\nReadableStreamAddReadRequest\r\n",
